hacks:[['Read the marks','[4 Marks] "justify" = 4 reasons with "because…". [6 Marks] calculation = show EVERY step (tree, table, f = g + h).'],
['Tie-break rule','When values tie, expand in <b>alphabetical order</b> unless told otherwise, and SAY so in your answer.'],
['Draw the tree','Search questions: draw the search tree and label each node with g, h, f. Mark the expanded node at each step. Highlight the final path and cost.'],
['Table everything','Dijkstra, CSP forward checking, perceptron and backprop: use a table with one row per step. Markers love tables.'],
['Name the property','Complete? Optimal? Time? Space? Use b, d, m, e.g. "BFS is O(b<sup>d</sup>) space".'],
['No linear regression','Your class tip: linear regression is excluded. Gradient descent is still explained (inside ANN training).']],
